{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":13,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/2-corinthians/13","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"This is the third time I am coming to you. In the mouth of two or three witnesses shall every word be established.","words":[["This",["G5124"]],["is the third",["G5154"]],["time I am coming",["G2064"]],["to",["G4314"]],["you.",["G5209"]],["In",["G1909"]],["the mouth",["G4750"]],["of two",["G1417"]],["or",["G2532"]],["three",["G5140"]],["witnesses",["G3144"]],["shall",["G2476"]],["every",["G3956"]],["word",["G4487"]],["be established.",["G2476"]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"I told you before, and foretell you, as if I were present, the second time; and being absent now I write to them which heretofore have sinned, and to all other, that, if I come again, I will not spare:","words":[["I told you before,",["G4280"]],["and",["G2532"]],["foretell you,",["G4302"]],["as if",["G5613"]],["I were present,",["G3918"]],["the second",["G1208"]],["time; and",["G2532"]],["being absent",["G548"]],["now",["G3568"]],["I write",["G1125"]],["to them which heretofore have sinned,",["G4258"]],["and",["G2532"]],["to all",["G3956"]],["other,",["G3062"]],["that,",["G3754"]],["if",["G1437"]],["I come",["G2064"]],["again,",["G1519","G3825"]],["I will",["G5339"]],["not",["G3756"]],["spare:",["G5339"]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"Since ye seek a proof of Christ speaking in me, which to you-ward is not weak, but is mighty in you.","words":[["Since",["G1893"]],["ye seek",["G2212"]],["a proof",["G1382"]],["of Christ",["G5547"]],["speaking",["G2980"]],["in",["G1722"]],["me,",["G1698"]],["which",["G3739"]],["to",["G1519"]],["you-ward is",["G770"]],["not",["G3756"]],["weak,",["G770"]],["but",["G235"]],["is mighty",["G1414"]],["in",["G1722"]],["you.",["G5213"]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"For though he was crucified through weakness, yet he liveth by the power of God. For we also are weak in him, but we shall live with him by the power of God toward you.","words":[["For",["G1063","G2532"]],["though",["G1487"]],["he was crucified",["G4717"]],["through",["G1537"]],["weakness,",["G769"]],["yet",["G235"]],["he liveth",["G2198"]],["by",["G1537"]],["the power",["G1411"]],["of God.",["G2316"]],["For",["G1063"]],["we",["G2249"]],["also",["G2532"]],["are weak",["G770"]],["in",["G1722"]],["him,",["G846"]],["but",["G235"]],["we shall live",["G2198"]],["with",["G4862"]],["him",["G846"]],["by",["G1537"]],["the power",["G1411"]],["of God",["G2316"]],["toward",["G1519"]],["you.",["G5209"]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"Examine yourselves, whether ye be in the faith; prove your own selves. Know ye not your own selves, how that Jesus Christ is in you, except ye be reprobates?","words":[["Examine",["G3985"]],["yourselves,",["G1438"]],["whether",["G1487"]],["ye be",["G2075"]],["in",["G1722"]],["the faith;",["G4102"]],["prove",["G1381"]],["your own selves.",["G1438","G2228"]],["Know ye",["G1921"]],["not",["G3756"]],["your own selves,",["G1438"]],["how that",["G3754"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["Christ",["G5547"]],["is",["G2076"]],["in",["G1722"]],["you,",["G5213"]],["except",["G1509"]],["ye be",["G2075"]],["reprobates?",["G5100","G96"]]]},{"verse":6,"text":"But I trust that ye shall know that we are not reprobates.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["I trust",["G1679"]],["that",["G3754"]],["ye shall know",["G1097"]],["that",["G3754"]],["we",["G2249"]],["are",["G2070"]],["not",["G3756"]],["reprobates.",["G96"]]]},{"verse":7,"text":"Now I pray to God that ye do no evil; not that we should appear approved, but that ye should do that which is honest, though we be as reprobates.","words":[["Now",["G1161"]],["I pray",["G2172"]],["to",["G4314"]],["God",["G2316"]],["that ye",["G5209"]],["do",["G3361","G4160"]],["no",["G3367"]],["evil;",["G2556"]],["not",["G3756"]],["that",["G2443"]],["we",["G2249"]],["should appear",["G5316"]],["approved,",["G1384"]],["but",["G235"]],["that",["G2443"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["should do",["G4160"]],["that which is honest,",["G2570"]],["though",["G1161"]],["we",["G2249"]],["be",["G5600"]],["as",["G5613"]],["reprobates.",["G96"]]]},{"verse":8,"text":"For we can do nothing against the truth, but for the truth.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["we can do",["G1410"]],["nothing",["G3756","G5100"]],["against",["G2596"]],["the truth,",["G225"]],["but",["G235"]],["for",["G5228"]],["the truth.",["G225"]]]},{"verse":9,"text":"For we are glad, when we are weak, and ye are strong: and this also we wish, even your perfection.","words":[["For",["G1063"]],["we",["G2249"]],["are glad,",["G5463"]],["when",["G3752"]],["we are weak,",["G770"]],["and",["G1161"]],["ye",["G5210"]],["are",["G5600"]],["strong:",["G1415"]],["and",["G1161"]],["this",["G5124"]],["also",["G2532"]],["we wish,",["G2172"]],["even your",["G5216"]],["perfection.",["G2676"]]]},{"verse":10,"text":"Therefore I write these things being absent, lest being present I should use sharpness, according to the power which the Lord hath given me to edification, and not to destruction.","words":[["Therefore",["G5124","G1223"]],["I write",["G1125"]],["these things",["G5023"]],["being absent,",["G548"]],["lest",["G3363"]],["being present",["G3918"]],["I should use",["G5530"]],["sharpness,",["G664"]],["according",["G2596"]],["to the power",["G1849"]],["which",["G3739"]],["the Lord",["G2962"]],["hath given",["G1325"]],["me",["G3427"]],["to",["G1519"]],["edification,",["G3619"]],["and",["G2532"]],["not",["G3756"]],["to",["G1519"]],["destruction.",["G2506"]]]},{"verse":11,"text":"Finally, brethren, farewell. Be perfect, be of good comfort, be of one mind, live in peace; and the God of love and peace shall be with you.","words":[["Finally,",["G3063"]],["brethren,",["G80"]],["farewell.",["G5463"]],["Be perfect,",["G2675"]],["be of good comfort,",["G3870"]],["be of one",["G846"]],["mind,",["G5426"]],["live in peace;",["G1514"]],["and",["G2532"]],["the God",["G2316"]],["of love",["G26"]],["and",["G2532"]],["peace",["G1515"]],["shall be",["G2071"]],["with",["G3326"]],["you.",["G5216"]]]},{"verse":12,"text":"Greet one another with an holy kiss.","words":[["Greet",["G782"]],["one another",["G240"]],["with",["G1722"]],["an holy",["G40"]],["kiss.",["G5370"]]]},{"verse":13,"text":"All the saints salute you.","words":[["All",["G3956"]],["the saints",["G40"]],["salute",["G782"]],["you.",["G5209"]]]},{"verse":14,"text":"The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ, and the love of God, and the communion of the Holy Ghost, be with you all. Amen. The second epistle to the Corinthians was written from Philippi, a city of Macedonia, by Titus and Lucas.","words":[["The grace",["G5485"]],["of the Lord",["G2962"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["Christ,",["G5547"]],["and",["G2532"]],["the love",["G26"]],["of God,",["G2316"]],["and",["G2532"]],["the communion",["G2842"]],["of the Holy",["G40"]],["Ghost,",["G4151"]],["be with",["G3326"]],["you",["G5216"]],["all.",["G3956"]],["Amen.",["G281"]],["The second epistle to the Corinthians was written from Philippi, a city of Macedonia, by Titus and Lucas.",[]]]}]}